  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Bring a large saucepan of salted water to the boil.\n• Finely chop garlic.\n• Slice lemon into wedges.\n• Pick and finely chop rosemary.\n• Halve snacking tomatoes.\n• Thinly slice flat mushrooms.\n• TIP: Run your fingers down the rosemary stalk to remove the leaves easily.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/688063207299475a5b0620fb/step-75292600.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Cook fettuccine in the boiling water until ‘al dente’, 11 minutes. Reserve some pasta water (see ingredients), then drain and return pasta to the saucepan. Add a drizzle of olive oil to prevent the pasta sticking together.\n• TIP: ‘Al dente’ pasta is cooked through but still slightly firm in the centre.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/688063207299475a5b0620fb/step-bd309c10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the pasta is cooking, heat a large frying pan over medium-high heat with the butter and a drizzle of olive oil. Cook mushrooms, tomatoes and rosemary, stirring until tender, 6-8 minutes.\n• Add garlic, stirring until fragrant, 1 minute.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/688063207299475a5b0620fb/step-ebca4620.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "To the pan with the mushrooms, add light cooking cream, herb & mushroom seasoning and the reserved pasta water. Stir to combine and simmer until slightly thickened, 2-3 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/688063207299475a5b0620fb/step-0ddb2030.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove pan from the heat, then add fettuccine, the pepper and half the Parmesan cheese. Gently toss to combine. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/688063207299475a5b0620fb/step-5d646940.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide creamy mushroom and rosemary fettuccine between bowls.\n• Top with remaining Parmesan cheese.\n• Serve with lemon wedges. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/688063207299475a5b0620fb/step-2b5b8850.jpg"
    }
  ]
